---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="关于 · 1971.xin"
  description="关于罗祥和这个网站：一个收工具、写东西、放想法的安静角落。"
>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-l">
        <p class="eyebrow rv"><span class="pulse"></span>ABOUT · 这个网站本身</p>
        <h1 class="rv" data-d="1">关于</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub rv" data-d="2">
          我是<b>罗祥</b>。这个域名是我在互联网上的门牌号 ——
          用来收邮件、放东西、以及记录一些没有更好去处的念头。
        </p>
        <p class="hero-sub rv" data-d="2">
          网站分两块：<b>工具库</b>收录我真实在用的东西，
          <b>文章</b>记录折腾的过程。没有恰饭，没有软文。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta rv" data-d="3">
          <a class="btn-main" href="mailto:luoxiang@agent.qq.com">
            <span>发封邮件</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn-ghost" href="/tools/">翻翻工具库</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-r rv" data-d="2">
        <div class="demo">
          <div class="demo-bar">
            <span class="demo-dot"></span>
            <span class="demo-dot"></span>
            <span class="demo-dot"></span>
            <span class="demo-title">~/about — how</span>
          </div>
          <div class="demo-body">
            <span class="ln"><span class="p">$</span> <span class="s">这个网站怎么做的</span></span>
            <span class="ln"><span class="c">·</span> 用 <span class="s">Astro</span> 生成，纯静态</span>
            <span class="ln"><span class="c">·</span> 代码放 <span class="s">GitHub</span>，push 自动部署</span>
            <span class="ln"><span class="c">·</span> 托管在 <span class="s">Cloudflare Pages</span></span>
            <span class="ln"><span class="c">·</span> 全球边缘节点，<span class="m">零服务器成本</span></span>
            <span class="ln"></span>
            <span class="ln"><span class="p">$</span> <span class="s">写给它的一句话</span></span>
            <span class="ln"><span class="m">够用就好。</span> <span class="cur"></span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
